                                "style": {
                                    "bold": true
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": " assignment (e.g., `MyClass <-\nsetClass(\"MyClass\", ...)`) were evaluated and registered.\n    *   S4 classes defined "
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "without",
                                "style": {
                                    "bold": true
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": " assignment (e.g., `setClass(\"MyClass\",\n...)`) were ignored.\n    *   S4 methods (typically defined using "
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
