                                "style": {
                                    "code": true
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": " without\nassignment) and S4 generics defined without assignment were also ignored.\n\n2.  **Missing NAMESPACE Filtering for S4 Objects:**\n    While "
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "undoc(dir=)",
                                "style": {
                                    "code": true
                                }
